From 231dcdcf6a1fbf624b591acf92f756fc2d1768e8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DCS <claude@dcs.io>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 01:01:55 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] sensitive content: revalidate images, show and end the
 unlock

Images (thumbnails, previews, originals) are now always revalidated by ETag
instead of reused from the browser cache for a day, so a tag added later, a
person hidden or a session locked takes effect at once. Thumbnail URLs gain
s=1 once, so images cached before this are fetched again. While the session
is unlocked with the PIN, the top bar shows an unlocked padlock that locks
it again.
